title: "Network Hierarchy: Where Sockets, TCP, and TLS Fit"
description: "A quick-reference guide to the network hierarchy, detailing where user-space sockets, TLS encryption, and the kernel network stack operate."
date: 2026-10-30
category: "Systems & Languages"
